Use Angular 22 and the officially compatible PrimeNG release pinned in w00. Use PrimeIcons.
Support Spanish-first i18n-ready UI, responsive mobile-first PWA behavior, centralized semantic
tokens, accessible contrast, and light/dark/system appearance. Validate UI in light and dark modes.
Do not add another general-purpose component library without an approved change.
